{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/563e4985c811e70da4e1ed07083678bb.avif?t=1758551397\" width=1560 height=159 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dynasthir Demo is a slice of our dark ages inspired 3rd-person A-RPG. We fractured our open world into a smaller piece for you to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In its dying breath, Dynasthir beckons. Bestowed upon you is the the first chapter of a story in a obscure world inviting methodical exploration, skillful combat &amp; profound moments of awe. Push into the unknown &amp; maybe you'll live to tell your tale.<br><br>The demo features a stripped down version of the play-space as the only difference between the full game and the demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Vibe </strong><br>It is a no handholding, figure it out yourself type demo that harkens back to old days. We put our trust in your playful sense of mind to approach with curiosity; a world which craves it.<strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action combat, rewarding <strong>skillful planning</strong> &amp; <strong>confidence</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/fb14b9ce966928261e2d5757852064c3.poster.avif?t=1758551397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/fb14b9ce966928261e2d5757852064c3.webm?t=1758551397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/fb14b9ce966928261e2d5757852064c3.mp4?t=1758551397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting lost</strong> in a world roaring at the seams, <strong>unraveling to your actions</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/b4dd9a71bffa400029fc8f72b39dbf30.poster.avif?t=1758551397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/b4dd9a71bffa400029fc8f72b39dbf30.webm?t=1758551397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observing enemy actions and <strong>learn</strong> their skills<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/6fafa238244f2e45cc6671cb08918227.poster.avif?t=1758551397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/6fafa238244f2e45cc6671cb08918227.webm?t=1758551397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/6fafa238244f2e45cc6671cb08918227.mp4?t=1758551397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Untangling <strong>bloodlines</strong> within; <strong>bring awareness</strong> to the past<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/c08bacd0ed13750762b00646251ca2c7.poster.avif?t=1758551397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002260/extras/c08bacd0ed13750762b00646251ca2c7.webm?t=1758551397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul